{"a":[34,35],"h":"<p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"157\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 157.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 33.7 33.7 40.6 47.3 65.3 72.0 78.7 78.7 96.7 96.7 105.0 120.7 120.7 127.6 127.6 134.3 134.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.6 47.3 72.0 85.6 85.6 105.0 127.6 141.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Onun için biz üzerlerine salıverdik:<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 78.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0 43.6 50.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"50.3 62.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> çakıl, taş yağdıran Melek yâhud rüzgâr: - üzerlerine siccilden istif edilmiş taşlar yağdırıyordu.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"116\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 116.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 30.0 38.3 38.3 54.8 65.3 65.3 81.0 81.0 85.6 93.0 93.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"54.8 85.6 99.8\" y=\"25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ancak Lûtun iyman eden mensubları müstesna - ki karısı haric olmak üzere ailesinden bir kaç kişi idi. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"139\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 138.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 24.0 48.7 48.7 64.6 64.6 73.6 73.6 82.6 89.3 96.0 96.0 102.7 102.7 115.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"24.0 36.7 36.7 89.3 102.7 115.6 122.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Onları bir sehar vakti, ya'ni sabaha yakın kurtardık. Selâmete çıkardık. 35. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"193\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 192.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 24.0 36.0 56.3 56.3 66.7 82.4 96.0 96.0 103.4 103.4 116.3 132.0 148.4 148.4 156.0 156.0 165.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 24.0 36.0 66.7 116.3 132.0 165.0 176.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> İşte biz, iyman-ü itaatla ni'metimize, şükreden kimseleri böyle karşılarız, böyle mükâfatlandırırız. </p>"}